  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "game-description-285d4905-306e-4c9c-ba78-256df7ea3781-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Doom sends a space marine through demon-infested bases and otherworldly spaces. Fast movement, weapon choice, and reading enemy attacks matter as much as aiming; levels also ask players to locate keys, switches, exits, and hidden areas. Its mixture of technological and infernal imagery makes the environment part of the game’s escalating rhythm."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-285d4905-306e-4c9c-ba78-256df7ea3781-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "The 1993 PC game circulated through a shareware model and supported networked cooperative play and deathmatch. Its editable WAD data files helped sustain a large community of custom maps and modifications. This entry covers that original game."
    },
